sequenceDiagram
    participant S as System
    participant O as Owner
    participant P as Prospect
    S->>S: Discover and research prospects
    S->>S: Extract opportunities
    S->>S: Qualify and prioritise
    S->>S: Generate personalised email
    S->>O: Request approval
    alt Approved
        O-->>S: Approve
        S->>P: Send email
        P-->>S: Response, if any
        S->>S: Record and plan follow-up
    else Rejected or edited
        O-->>S: Edit or reject
        S->>S: Revise or discard
    end
